  "description": "Han So-Eun finds herself preparing a photo exhibition ahead of the school festival. As she takes photos with Yun Ji-Hu, a boy she met by chance, her ordinary daily life gradually begins to feel special. But behind her smiling face lay a secret she couldn’t share with anyone. A story about our first love and coming of age at the age of eighteen, the most radiant time of our lives.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
